  = help: the trait `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, f32>` is not implemented for `&bough::signal::Signal<bough::color::Color>`
  = note: a signal is passed by reference, `&self.x`, so the port can follow it; a value of another type goes through `self.x.map(f)`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'f, T>`:
            `&bough::signal::Signal<String>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<T>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, T>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<i16>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<i32>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<i64>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<i8>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<isize>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
            `&bough::signal::Signal<u16>` implements `bough::prelude::IntoProp<'_, bough::el::plug::Text>`
          and $N others
